{
    "title": "My Passion: Reading App",
    "description": "Are books & literature your hobby? Then My Passion is the perfect reading app for you. It gives you an infinite supply of stories with emotional depth, and you can choose any good book you like, be it a fantasy novel, tales of relationships, or mystery.\r\n\r\nWhen it's time to relax after dark, there's nothing better than to sink your teeth into the next chapter of a good novel. If you're a light reader, perhaps a storybook about human connections will bring to mind the dream of falling freshly in love. Or perhaps you're into werewolf tales?\r\n\r\nWhatever your preferences may be, the idea behind My Passion is to provide an online reading platform where you can enjoy thousands of web novels and have a good read at your convenience. The reading app's library consists of diverse novel and book offerings, which means there is something to be found for everyone, whether you're into fantasy, stories of relationships, or something else entirely (including exciting short stories).\r\n\r\nAre you looking for stories to enjoy as you bask in the sunlight at the beach? You can access any fantastic tales of vampires and human connections from your smartphone or pad. If you're at home, why not try something exciting? After all, emotionally engaging novels are known for their capacity to take you on a fun story journey where characters meet and make their world complete.\r\n\r\nInside the app, you will find any stories and genres you can think of. From suspense all the way to werewolves, marriage, paranormal, and others, My Passion is an ebook collection that acts as your personal bookstore to take with you, anywhere and anytime. In fact, you can count on novel updates to be released daily; the people who write them are award-winning fiction writers.\r\n\r\nMy Passion: Fiction Books is one of the story apps with a strong focus on personalizing your user experience. For example, if you're tired of the defaults and you'd prefer to choose from more fonts for the perfect emotionally engaging fantasy ebook experience, this is the perfect place to read your ebooks. In addition, the app allows you to manage your favorites and add them to your personal library as you take book breaks either online or offline.\r\n\r\nFeatures at a glance:\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Free samples\r\n\u2714\ufe0f My novel library\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Offline mode\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Personalized read recommendations\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Custom fonts\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Dark mode\r\n\r\nSpecial offers:\r\nDaily rewards. Collect them for 6 days in a row to claim your Super Gift.\r\nReading rewards. Keep reading for 15 minutes to get coins automatically.\r\nEarn coins just for creating an account.\r\nEarn coins by watching an ad.\r\n\r\nWith My Passion, werewolf, and stories of human connections await at your fingertips. Enjoy unlimited good novel recommendations as you manage your web novel library.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are books &amp; literature your hobby? Then My Passion is the perfect reading app for you. It gives you an infinite supply of stories with emotional depth, and you can choose any good book you like, be it a fantasy novel, tales of relationships, or mystery.<br><br>When it&#39;s time to relax after dark, there&#39;s nothing better than to sink your teeth into the next chapter of a good novel. If you&#39;re a light reader, perhaps a storybook about human connections will bring to mind the dream of falling freshly in love. Or perhaps you&#39;re into werewolf tales?<br><br>Whatever your preferences may be, the idea behind My Passion is to provide an online reading platform where you can enjoy thousands of web novels and have a good read at your convenience. The reading app&#39;s library consists of diverse novel and book offerings, which means there is something to be found for everyone, whether you&#39;re into fantasy, stories of relationships, or something else entirely (including exciting short stories).<br><br>Are you looking for stories to enjoy as you bask in the sunlight at the beach? You can access any fantastic tales of vampires and human connections from your smartphone or pad. If you&#39;re at home, why not try something exciting? After all, emotionally engaging novels are known for their capacity to take you on a fun story journey where characters meet and make their world complete.<br><br>Inside the app, you will find any stories and genres you can think of. From suspense all the way to werewolves, marriage, paranormal, and others, My Passion is an ebook collection that acts as your personal bookstore to take with you, anywhere and anytime. In fact, you can count on novel updates to be released daily; the people who write them are award-winning fiction writers.<br><br>My Passion: Fiction Books is one of the story apps with a strong focus on personalizing your user experience. For example, if you&#39;re tired of the defaults and you&#39;d prefer to choose from more fonts for the perfect emotionally engaging fantasy ebook experience, this is the perfect place to read your ebooks. In addition, the app allows you to manage your favorites and add them to your personal library as you take book breaks either online or offline.<br><br>Features at a glance:<br>\u2714\ufe0f Free samples<br>\u2714\ufe0f My novel library<br>\u2714\ufe0f Offline mode<br>\u2714\ufe0f Personalized read recommendations<br>\u2714\ufe0f Custom fonts<br>\u2714\ufe0f Dark mode<br><br>Special offers:<br>Daily rewards. Collect them for 6 days in a row to claim your Super Gift.<br>Reading rewards. Keep reading for 15 minutes to get coins automatically.<br>Earn coins just for creating an account.<br>Earn coins by watching an ad.<br><br>With My Passion, werewolf, and stories of human connections await at your fingertips. Enjoy unlimited good novel recommendations as you manage your web novel library.",
